WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.104
Welcome to your Bold firm partner portal.

2
00:00:03.104 --> 00:00:05.982
This walkthrough uses example clients.

3
00:00:05.982 --> 00:00:09.389
Sign in with the account linked to your firm.

4
00:00:09.389 --> 00:00:15.371
Your workspace shows your appointments, availability, and consultation credits.

5
00:00:15.371 --> 00:00:18.778
Available credits are ready for new bookings.

6
00:00:18.778 --> 00:00:22.109
Reserved credits cover booked consultations.

7
00:00:22.109 --> 00:00:26.274
Used credits are consultations the client has attended.

8
00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:31.347
A no-show, cancellation, or disqualification does not use a credit.

9
00:00:31.347 --> 00:00:34.042
Open Appointments to see your bookings.

10
00:00:34.042 --> 00:00:39.778
Select a client to review the consultation time, contact details, and client intel.

11
00:00:39.778 --> 00:00:43.441
Check the other party's name before the consultation.

12
00:00:43.441 --> 00:00:48.141
If you identify a conflict, use Flag conflict so Bold can review it.

13
00:00:48.141 --> 00:00:51.251
You can add a note to keep the team informed.

14
00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:54.292
Use Reschedule when a booking needs to move.

15
00:00:54.292 --> 00:00:57.402
Choose a date, then choose an available time.

16
00:00:57.402 --> 00:01:03.483
The available times respect your operating hours, blocked time, and appointment
buffers.

17
00:01:03.483 --> 00:01:07.495
After a consultation, open the appointment and select Showed up.

18
00:01:07.495 --> 00:01:13.638
If you want to record a summary or that the client signed, use Showed up plus add
notes or signed.

19
00:01:13.638 --> 00:01:16.458
If the client did not attend, select No show.

20
00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:18.590
This releases the reserved credit.

21
00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:22.476
Use the follow-up option when you need Bold to chase a client.

22
00:01:22.476 --> 00:01:26.425
Keep outcomes up to date so your credit balance stays accurate.

23
00:01:26.425 --> 00:01:29.132
Open Availability to manage your calendar.

24
00:01:29.132 --> 00:01:33.064
The week view shows consultations, buffers, and blocked time.

25
00:01:33.064 --> 00:01:40.347
Use Settings to set your consultation length, the buffer between clients, and your
normal weekly operating hours.

26
00:01:40.347 --> 00:01:42.539
The buffer is added automatically.

27
00:01:42.539 --> 00:01:50.789
For example, a sixty minute consultation followed by a fifteen minute buffer leaves a
fifteen minute gap before the next client.

28
00:01:50.789 --> 00:01:56.332
Review any confirmation carefully before changing the length of existing appointments.

29
00:01:56.332 --> 00:02:02.769
To make time unavailable, select or drag across free time in the calendar and save the
block.

30
00:02:02.769 --> 00:02:06.437
You can also adjust a particular day's opening hours.

31
00:02:06.437 --> 00:02:12.389
Existing bookings are protected: a block cannot be saved across a booked consultation.

32
00:02:12.389 --> 00:02:15.019
Review the calendar after each change.

33
00:02:15.019 --> 00:02:21.456
If a change creates a warning, check the affected appointments before making further
changes.

34
00:02:21.456 --> 00:02:24.461
When you need more credits, select Add Pack.

35
00:02:24.461 --> 00:02:29.377
Choose ten, twenty, thirty, or fifty credits, or enter another quantity.

36
00:02:29.377 --> 00:02:33.953
Check the balance shown after adding the pack, then select Confirm.

37
00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:38.255
The credits are added immediately at your existing agreed rate.

38
00:02:38.255 --> 00:02:42.216
Bold receives an internal notification to arrange payment.

39
00:02:42.216 --> 00:02:45.152
No payment is collected by this button yet.

40
00:02:45.152 --> 00:02:47.610
Any credits owing are covered first.

41
00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:52.664
Wait for the success message, select Done, and continue using your portal.
